id: proxy-login
section: Proxies and certificates
item: A proxy that asks for a login (tools/host/auth-proxy.py on the host): the user name and password typed on the keyboard in the card's dialog, and the page loads
shells: enyo mochi
page: about:settings
prefs: network.proxy.type=1 network.proxy.http=192.168.1.245 network.proxy.http_port=3129
kit: cavekit-proxies-certs.md R5
fixture: auth-proxy
wait rect page-title 20
calibrate page-title
inject url http://example.com/jihad-proxy-login
expect dialog present 30
wait still 200,100,756,700 4
shoot auth-dialog
chrome auth-user
expect keyboard up 8
type-keys jihad
chrome kb-hide
expect keyboard down 8
wait still 200,100,756,700 4
chrome auth-pass
expect keyboard up 8
type-keys touchpad
chrome kb-hide
expect keyboard down 8
wait still 200,100,756,700 4
chrome auth-ok
expect dialog answered 8
wait line 'load done uri=http://example.com' 40
